    <string name="about_text">Glyde is a standalone app that bypasses DPI throttling and blocking on Android. It is not a VPN: traffic goes straight to websites without third-party servers. Glyde only changes the shape of packets so the ISP filter cannot recognize them. Automatic route planning, auto repair, Telegram boost and the Air glass design.</string>
    <string name="about_dev">Developer: GREENTUNE</string>
